# Copy to .env and fill in before running a native build (expo prebuild / run).
# This key renders Google Maps tiles on ANDROID. iOS uses Apple Maps (no key).
#
# Create it in Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials.
# Enable "Maps SDK for Android" for this key. Restrict it to your Android app's
# package (com.iannorris.trace) + SHA-1 for production.
#
# This is the CLIENT key (ships in the Android app). The Worker's server-side
# Places/Directions/Geocoding key is separate — set that with `wrangler secret`,
# never here. See worker/wrangler.toml.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
